Change(genesis='66602cd0dec37d58d03eec9518ca805a7ac38ea912d2b0c366a0b67b4b9f50b6', deps=(), event=Decided(decision='mergegate', at=datetime(2026, 9, 28, 0, 0, 0), actor='assistant', title='The merge gate is scripts/merge-gate.sh; a branch reaches master only through a green run of it', body="*The merge gate is `scripts/merge-gate.sh`* (2026-09-28): `nix develop .#triage -c scripts/merge-gate.sh` runs fmt, clippy both ways, the workspace tests, `live` and `guards`, web-test, build-web (tsc), the whole e2e suite and `.#suzatary-web`, every step even after a failure, and prints each step's result and time. A branch reaches master only through a green run of it.", rationale='Decided 2026-09-28.', supersedes=()))